Date: Wed, 26 Apr 2023 18:44:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 035/191] dmaengine: andes: atcdmac300g: support cyclic mode

1. Support cyclic mode
2. Fine-tune the DMAC driver to avoid potential risks.
3. Change the address aligned from 32 to 64
   when creating the descriptor memory pool.

Signed-off-by: CL Wang <cl634@andestech.com>
